{"id":7020,"date":"2020-03-08T00:31:35","date_gmt":"2020-03-08T04:31:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7020"},"modified":"2020-03-08T09:03:09","modified_gmt":"2020-03-08T13:03:09","slug":"only-a-couple-hiccups","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/03\/08\/only-a-couple-hiccups\/","title":{"rendered":"Only a Couple Hiccups"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We&#8217;ll, after a few 400+ mile days we finally made it to our destination of Holt, Florida. We left Casa Grande AZ Monday about noon after my medical appointment and wanted to get to Holt by Friday morning since my friend Dave has every other Friday off work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We got settled in to a great little State Park just west of Holt, Florida and only about 25 miles from Dave and Robyn&#8217;s house.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7021\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_111341-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Our site at Blackwater River State Park<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Once we got settled in we drove on over to Crestview and spent the rest of the day with our good friends who we hadn&#8217;t seen in just about two years.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dave and I left the girls at the house and ran over to the local hardware to get some cable and clamps to replace one of the broken safety cables on our tow bar.  I must&#8217;ve not connected it fully when we left Arizona and it dragged on the highway 1700 miles and just chewed off the end.  Imagine that!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7022\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_102109-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>So we started back to the house and something just didn&#8217;t feel right. It felt as though the car was sluggish. I had to give it more gas to go and it didn&#8217;t want to coast when I took my foot off the accelerator. I suspected one of the brake calipers had locked up .. unfortunately I was correct. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But Dave knew a shop just down the street and we drove it right over.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7023\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_162549-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our little Saturn up on the rack<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Within an hour he had the rotor and all the front brake pads replaced.  Great service!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We went back and picked up the girls and went to a great little fresh seafood restaurant right around the corner from their house. We had eaten here two years ago with Dave and Robyn and got free meals from a total stranger that night. We were kinda hoping for the same this year,\ud83d\ude01 but it didn&#8217;t work that way. But nonetheless we had great meals with great friends.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7025\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200306_192412-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Emerald Isle Seafood @ Crestview FL<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Today they came to the campground and picked us up and we all visited a great little Arts &amp; Music Festival in the river town of Milton west of Crestview heading toward Pensacola.  We enjoyed the sunshine, the ice cream, and our time together.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7026\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141333-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>They&#8217;re having a duck race on the river to raise money for some good cause (I don&#8217;t remember what)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7027\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_140720-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Kathy thought they were cute .. she bought a Zebra Duck<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Kathy bought a \ud83e\udd86 for $5 .. she could win $1500!  We won&#8217;t know until the race happens on July 4th.  They have our phone number to call when we win.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After dinner, Dave and Robyn dropped us off back at the campground.  We had just walked into the coach and taken our jackets off and there was a knock at the door.  Kathy answered and the fella outside introduced himself as Dave Butzky who we went to high school with back in the early 70&#8217;s!!!!!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We invited them in and had a great time together.  Thanks to Facebook (we have been FB Friends for about a year now) Dave saw that we were close by so they drive over for a visit!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-1024x485.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7028\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-2000x947.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_200730-scaled.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Dave and Pam<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Dave and Pam have been full-timing for about two years now and so we have a lot in common and enjoyed our time together. We look forward to the next time we can meet up!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Lots more to come.  We&#8217;ll be in Florida for the next two weeks and there&#8217;s a lot more to see and do, so we&#8217;ll be sharing that as the days roll on.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>See ya&#8217; next time!  Till then .. be good to yourself and those around you.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We&#8217;ll, after a few 400+ mile days we finally made it to our destination of Holt, Florida. We left Casa Grande AZ Monday about noon after my medical appointment and wanted to get to Holt by Friday morning since my friend Dave has every other Friday off work. We got settled in to a great &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/03\/08\/only-a-couple-hiccups\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Only a Couple Hiccups<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":7032,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,18285,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707870,554707338,554707867,554707869,554707864,554707866,554707337,554707865,554707868,554707427],"class_list":["post-7020","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-camping","category-equipment","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-blackwater","tag-crestview","tag-dave","tag-driving","tag-festival","tag-hayden","tag-holt","tag-milton","tag-robyn","tag-state-park"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7020","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7020"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7020\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7030,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7020\/revisions\/7030"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7032"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7020"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7020"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7020"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}